---

## What this covers

Visual Director ships as two plain-text bundles:

- **Lite** — the free bundle.
- **Pro** — the paid bundle. Pro is a **one-time purchase of US$19** that
  includes **ongoing access to updates**. It is **not a subscription** —
  there is no recurring charge, and you are not billed again to keep using
  what you bought. (See decision D-006.)

Both bundles are plain-text files (skill instructions, reference notes, and
renderer profiles). There is no code, no API, and no runtime connection —
nothing phones home. You can read every file. Protection is by this licence,
not by secrecy or DRM.

Where this licence says **"the bundle"** it means these files themselves —
the Visual Director Lite and/or Pro bundle you received. Where it says
**"your output"** it means the image direction, prompts, and images you
produce by using the bundle.

---

## What you MAY do

1. **Use it personally.** Use Lite and (if you bought it) Pro for your own
   projects, on your own machines, as much as you like.

2. **Use it commercially.** Use the bundle in your paid work, for your
   clients, and inside your business. You do **not** owe any extra fee or
   royalty for commercial use.

3. **Use and sell your output freely.** This licence places **no restriction**
   on the image direction, prompts, and images you create with Visual Director.
   Use and sell that output — personally or commercially — including in client
   work, products, videos, listings, and print. This licence claims no ownership
   over what you make with the tool. (Whether AI-generated images can themselves
   be owned or copyrighted is an unsettled, jurisdiction-specific legal question
   this licence does not decide.)

4. **Read and adapt it for yourself.** Because the files are plain text, you
   may read them and make private changes for your own use.

---

## What you MAY NOT do

1. **No resale of the bundle.** You may not sell, sublicense, rent, or
   otherwise charge anyone for the Visual Director bundle itself (Lite or Pro),
   in whole or in part, whether unchanged or modified.

2. **No redistribution of the bundle.** You may not republish, repackage,
   mirror, or hand out the bundle's files — including the Pro files, the
   renderer profiles, and any reference notes — to other people or the public.
   Point people to the official source instead. (Sharing *your output* is fine;
   sharing *the files* is not.)

3. **No passing it off as your own.** You may not present the bundle, or a
   renamed/reskinned copy of it, as your own product or skill.

The short version: **what you make with Visual Director is yours to use and
sell; the Visual Director bundle itself is not yours to resell or give away.**

---

## Refunds

If Visual Director isn't what was described, or doesn't work for you, you can
request a refund within **7 days** of purchase through Gumroad. Because the
bundle is plain-text files delivered instantly, refunds outside that window are
at Meridian Labs Software's discretion. This does not limit any refund rights you have under
applicable consumer law.

---

## Third-party rendering tools

Visual Director writes image *direction* — it does not render images and is
**not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to** any image tool it names
(including ChatGPT / GPT Image, Midjourney, Google Gemini, Ideogram, or FLUX).
You render with those tools yourself, and you are responsible for complying with
**their** terms of service and content policies.

---

## No warranty

Visual Director is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. Image
models change, and results vary. To the extent allowed by law, Meridian Labs
Software is not liable for any loss or damage arising from use of the bundle or its
output.

